#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:9
msgid "Develop with TDD and normal commit gates"
msgstr "使用 TDD 与正常提交门禁开发"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:11
msgid ""
"This workflow preserves current C11 architecture, formatting and explicit "
"evidence. Codex owns platform maintenance; independent agents review high-"
"risk changes. No fictitious personnel or local file can establish GitHub "
"branch protection."
msgstr ""
"本工作流保留当前 C11 架构、格式与显式证据。Codex 负责平台维护；独立 agent 审查高风险变更。虚构人员或本地文件都不能建立 GitHub "
"分支保护。"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:15
msgid "Install and check tools"
msgstr "安装并检查工具"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:17
msgid ""
"First complete the [fixed source and recursive dependency "
"guide](../guides/source-checkout.md). From that repository root, install the"
" maintenance tools:"
msgstr "先完成[固定源码与递归依赖指南](../guides/source-checkout.md)。然后从该仓库根目录安装维护工具："

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:26
msgid ""
"Windows uses `.venv/Scripts/python.exe`. Installation establishes pre-commit"
" and commit-msg hooks. Hooks inspect staged inputs without staging or "
"silently fixing files. Preserve unstaged work and actual failure "
"diagnostics; never bypass hooks."
msgstr ""
"Windows 使用 `.venv/Scripts/python.exe`。安装建立 pre-commit 和 commit-msg "
"钩子。钩子检查暂存输入，不替用户暂存，也不静默修复文件。保留未暂存工作和真实失败诊断；不得绕过钩子。"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:30
msgid "Prepare the pinned host test framework"
msgstr "准备锁定的主机测试框架"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:32
msgid ""
"GoogleTest and GoogleMock are provided by the Git submodule "
"`ext/googletest`. The lock records official version 1.16.0 at upstream base "
"`6910c9d9165801d8827d628cb72eb7ea9dd538c5`; the Gitlink and selected lock "
"commit pin organization patch `58ec32c09ed8a099e55cbdab9418597c4fd9b14f` on "
"that base, including the host-test `RE` copy-assignment ownership fix. "
"Dependency inventory records the official upstream base and the selected "
"patch separately. The recursive checkout above includes it. For an existing "
"checkout, prepare the Native dependency scope explicitly before running "
"tests:"
msgstr ""
"GoogleTest 和 GoogleMock 由 Git 子模块 `ext/googletest` 提供。锁文件记录官方 1.16.0 的 "
"upstream 基线 `6910c9d9165801d8827d628cb72eb7ea9dd538c5`；Gitlink 与锁文件所选 commit"
" 固定该基线上的组织补丁 `58ec32c09ed8a099e55cbdab9418597c4fd9b14f`，其中包含 host 测试框架 `RE` "
"复制赋值的所有权修复。依赖清单分别记录官方 upstream 基线与所选补丁。 上面的递归 checkout 包含该子模块。对于已有 "
"checkout，请在运行测试前显式准备 Native 依赖范围："

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:40
msgid ""
"To initialize only this submodule, use `git submodule update --init "
"--recursive ext/googletest` instead. Preparation may use the network; CMake "
"configuration uses only the prepared local source and fails if the required "
"source is missing, differs from the pin or has local modifications. It "
"neither fetches a dependency nor substitutes a system installation. The "
"framework stays in the host test graph; ARM builds and firmware SDK "
"consumers do not require it."
msgstr ""
"如果只需初始化此子模块，可改用 `git submodule update --init --recursive "
"ext/googletest`。准备阶段可以使用网络；CMake "
"配置只使用已准备的本地源码，缺失、版本与锁定值不符或存在本地修改均失败。配置过程不获取依赖，也不使用系统安装替代。框架只进入主机测试目标图；ARM "
"构建和固件 SDK 消费者不需要它。"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:48
msgid "Execute RED, GREEN and review"
msgstr "执行 RED、GREEN 与评审"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:50
msgid ""
"For new C behavior or defect fixes, first add a meaningful "
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock regression. Execute it and retain the expected failure"
" reason and original command. Implement the smallest correct production "
"change, execute GREEN, then refactor. Mock external ports/MMIO, not the "
"implementation being tested. Cover relevant rejection, cancellation, drain, "
"overflow, quarantine and instance isolation. Python production tools use "
"stdlib unittest with the same actual RED/GREEN rule."
msgstr ""
"新增 C 行为或修复缺陷时，先添加有意义的 GoogleTest／GoogleMock 回归。执行并保留预期失败原因与原命令。实现最小正确生产变更，执行"
" GREEN，再重构。Mock 外部端口／MMIO，而不是被测实现。覆盖相关拒绝、取消、排空、溢出、隔离保留和实例隔离。Python 生产工具使用标准库"
" unittest，遵循相同实际 RED／GREEN 规则。"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:61
msgid ""
"The full gate builds the pinned offline framework and executes discovered "
"cases with fresh reports and no filters/shards. Empty, skipped, partial, "
"stale or changed inputs fail. The hook checks the staged tree remains "
"unchanged; CI independently executes the gate. The framework is host-only "
"C++17; firmware remains C11. Automation proves execution, while retained "
"development logs document historical RED/GREEN order. Pure prose or diagram "
"edits need corresponding document checks and semantic review rather than "
"mirrored implementation tests."
msgstr ""
"完整门禁构建锁定的离线框架，以新报告执行发现的全部用例，不使用 "
"filter／shard。空、跳过、部分、陈旧或变化输入均失败。钩子核对暂存树保持不变；CI 独立执行门禁。框架仅用于主机 C++17；固件保持 "
"C11。自动化证明执行，保留的开发日志记录历史 RED／GREEN 顺序。纯正文或图源修改需要对应文档检查和语义审查，不需要镜像实现测试。"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:69
msgid "Run local validation when Actions is unavailable"
msgstr "Actions 不可用时执行本地验证"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:71
msgid ""
"Use the same maintained entry points as CI. The complete TDD gate above runs"
" Native GoogleTest and all four tool domains; independent runtime validation"
" uses `native_contracts.py` after configuring and building each of `native-"
"debug`, `native-release`, `native-asan` and `native-tsan`. The retained "
"contract suite, strict bilingual documentation build and independent Source "
"SDK consumers verify their separate boundaries. See the [engineering "
"handbook](../design/engineering-handbook.md) for scope and concurrency "
"rules."
msgstr ""
"使用与 CI 相同的维护入口。上述完整 TDD 门禁执行 Native GoogleTest 和四个完整工具域；独立运行验证先分别配置、构建 "
"`native-debug`、`native-release`、`native-asan` 和 `native-tsan`，再执行 "
"`native_contracts.py`。保留的合同测试、严格双语文档构建和独立 Source SDK "
"消费者分别验证各自边界。范围及并发规则见[工程手册](../design/engineering-handbook.md)。"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:79
msgid ""
"Record actual source commit, configuration, tool identities, commands, exit "
"codes and fresh reports in the pull request. A failed, partial or "
"interrupted run keeps its real result. Local execution does not establish a "
"GitHub Actions status, server branch rule, software release or physical HIL "
"result."
msgstr ""
"在 PR 中记录实际源码提交、配置、工具身份、命令、退出码和新生成的报告。失败、部分完成或中断的执行保留真实结果。本地执行不建立 GitHub "
"Actions 状态、服务端分支规则、软件发布或物理 HIL 结果。"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:84
msgid "Keep feedback fast and evidence complete"
msgstr "快速反馈与完整证据"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:86
msgid ""
"Use a focused development run for the behavior being changed, then execute "
"the normal complete acceptance gates for the final source. Discover the "
"maintained case names instead of adding duplicate test programs. Retain the "
"original RED failure, GREEN result and actual command. A filter or a cached "
"result cannot qualify a complete candidate."
msgstr ""
"先对修改的行为执行定向开发测试，再对最终源码执行正常完整验收门禁。发现已维护的测试名称，不增加重复测试程序。保留原始 RED 失败、GREEN "
"结果和实际命令。过滤执行或缓存结果不能使完整候选通过验收。"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:92
msgid ""
"`python tools/dev/dev.py timings /path/to/receipts` summarizes existing "
"process receipts without rerunning work. Separate preparation, "
"configuration, compilation, tests, documentation and SDK consumption. "
"Preserve failed/cancelled attempts and unknown CPU or RSS observations; "
"overlapping wall times are not additive elapsed time. Compare equivalent "
"source/tool/profile scopes before attributing a speedup."
msgstr ""
"`python tools/dev/dev.py timings /path/to/receipts` 汇总已有进程 "
"receipt，不重新运行工作。分别观察准备、配置、编译、测试、文档和 SDK 消费。保留失败／取消的尝试以及未观测的 CPU 或 "
"RSS；重叠的墙钟时间不能相加作为总耗时。比较等价源码、工具与配置范围后再归因提速。"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:98
msgid ""
"On Linux, a normally reaped process, including a nonzero exit, can have "
"`resource_usage` observed by `wait4`: user/system CPU seconds and "
"`maximum_process_rss_bytes`. The scope is the waited process and descendants"
" it has already reaped. The RSS value is the largest observed single-process"
" peak, not simultaneous process-tree memory. Timeout, cancellation, launch "
"failure, older receipts and other platforms retain unknown values rather "
"than estimating them from wall time."
msgstr ""
"在 Linux 上，正常回收的进程（包括非零退出）可带有由 `wait4` 观测的 `resource_usage`：用户态／内核态 CPU 秒数和 "
"`maximum_process_rss_bytes`。范围是被等待的进程及其已经回收的后代。RSS "
"值是观测到的最大单进程峰值，不是整个进程树的同时占用。超时、取消、启动失败、旧收据和其他平台保留未知值，不从墙钟耗时估算。"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:106
msgid ""
"The timings summary exposes `measured_resource_attempts` and "
"`maximum_observed_process_rss_bytes` while preserving each original receipt."
" Aggregate `cpu_seconds`, `peak_rss_bytes` and `cache_hits` remain unknown "
"because nested receipts can double-count work and these observations do not "
"establish a global memory peak or cache behavior. Compare cold and warm "
"attempts separately under the same toolchain, source and profile; "
"measurements from a small tool regression do not quantify whole-project "
"build improvement."
msgstr ""
"耗时汇总公开 `measured_resource_attempts` 和 "
"`maximum_observed_process_rss_bytes`，同时保留每份原始收据。汇总的 "
"`cpu_seconds`、`peak_rss_bytes` 和 `cache_hits` "
"仍为未知，因为嵌套收据可能重复计算工作，这些观测也不能建立全局内存峰值或缓存行为。分别比较同一工具链、源码和 profile 下的 cold 与 "
"warm 尝试；小型工具回归的测量不能量化全项目构建收益。"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:114
msgid ""
"Choose an explicit finite compiler budget for available RAM and disk, not "
"just CPU count. Reuse verified source/tool preparation and ordinary "
"incremental builds; invalidate changed configuration, dependencies and "
"generated inputs normally. Do not cache acceptance reports, restore "
"incompatible objects or parallelize two mutations of the same build tree. "
"Full gate discovery, actual exits, output identities and "
"failure/cancellation retention remain mandatory."
msgstr ""
"根据可用 RAM 与磁盘显式选择有限编译并发预算，不能只看 CPU "
"数量。复用已验证的源码／工具准备与正常增量构建；按正常规则使改变的配置、依赖和生成输入失效。不得缓存验收报告、恢复不相容的对象或同时修改同一构建树。完整门禁发现、实际退出码、输出身份及失败／取消保留仍为必需。"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:121
msgid ""
"The commit gate configures and builds once for unchanged staged inputs, then"
" runs all Native GoogleTest cases and affected complete tool domains. "
"Build/configuration policy changes run every tool domain. Complete CI runs "
"the four Native modes and all maintained tool domains separately, without "
"repeating tool tests per mode."
msgstr ""
"提交门禁对未变更的暂存输入只配置、构建一次，然后执行全部 Native GoogleTest "
"和受影响的完整工具域。构建或配置策略变更执行所有工具域。完整 CI 将四种 Native 模式和所有维护中的工具域分开执行，避免逐模式重复工具测试。"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:126
msgid ""
"Before deleting a test, identify its behavioral obligation and independent "
"remaining coverage. Remove only an obsolete behavior or a demonstrated "
"duplicate of the same contract. Keep tests that expose rejected ownership, "
"retained borrows, instance isolation, cancellation, IRQ ordering, real "
"vendor behavior or external SDK consumption. A passing implementation-shaped"
" assertion alone is not an independent substitute. If the audit finds no "
"safe deletion, retain the test; shrinking a count is not an optimization "
"objective."
msgstr ""
"删除测试前，指出其行为责任和仍存在的独立覆盖。仅删除过时行为或已经证明重复覆盖同一合同的测试。保留检查拒绝所有权、借用保留、实例隔离、取消、IRQ "
"顺序、真实厂家行为或外部 SDK 消费的测试。照着实现编写的通过断言本身不能作为独立替代。审查未找到可安全删除的测试时应保留；减少测试数量不是优化目标。"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:134
msgid "Preserve style and scope"
msgstr "保留风格与范围"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:136
msgid ""
"Use the unchanged `.clang-format` and `.editorconfig`: 80 columns, four "
"spaces, attached braces, type-attached pointer stars and backslash Doxygen "
"comments. Public headers document context, deadline, ownership and failures."
" Source comments explain invariants and hardware ordering instead of "
"repeating declaration parameters. New/changed files pass whole-file checks; "
"existing frozen debt may only shrink."
msgstr ""
"使用未改变的 `.clang-format` 和 `.editorconfig`：80 列、四空格、附着大括号、类型侧指针星号和反斜杠 Doxygen "
"注释。公共头文件说明上下文、截止时间、所有权和失败。源注释解释不变量和硬件顺序，不重复声明参数。新增／修改文件通过整文件检查；已有冻结欠账只能减少。"

#: ../../../docs/development/workflow.md:142
msgid ""
"Commit one reviewable change with Conventional Commits. Review "
"interface/configuration changes together with diagrams, examples, "
"translation and execution scope. Keep products, workers, private PCB and "
"recovery policy outside Nexus. Record actual source/configuration/tool/ELF "
"identities and physical pending items; a successful commit or CI does not "
"promote a product release."
msgstr ""
"每次使用 Conventional Commits 提交一个可评审变更。将接口／配置变化与图示、示例、翻译和执行范围一起评审。产品、执行任务、私有 "
"PCB 和恢复策略保留在 Nexus 外。记录实际源码／配置／工具／ELF 身份与物理待执行项；成功 commit 或 CI 不将结果升级为产品发行。"
